ELECTRUM

Bitcoin Wallet

Dear Customer,

As part of our ongoing commitment to meeting evolving regulatory standards =
and maintaining the highest level of security for our customers, Electrum i=
s updating certain compliance procedures relating to your account.

These updates are intended to support our regulatory obligations while help=
ing us continue to provide secure and reliable digital asset services.

What's Changing

1. Enhanced Compliance Information

Additional information may be requested for certain account activities and =
digital asset transfers where required under applicable regulations.

2. Transfer Verification Requirements

Some cryptocurrency deposits and withdrawals may require additional sender =
or recipient information before processing. These measures are designed to =
support industry compliance standards and help protect customers from unaut=
horized or high-risk transactions.

3. Customer Information Review

Periodically, you may be asked to review or confirm account information to =
ensure your profile remains accurate and up to date.


ACTION REQUIRED: COMPLETE YOUR ACCOUNT REVIEW

To help ensure uninterrupted access to your account, complete the requested=
 compliance review within 14 business days of receiving this notification.

If no action is taken before the deadline, certain account features may be =
temporarily unavailable until the required review has been completed.

To make the process as simple as possible, choose the option that best suit=
s you:

Option 1: Schedule a Compliance Review

Book a short session with an agent of our support team. We'll explain the u=
pdates, answer your questions, and guide you through the verification proce=
ss.

Schedule Your Session https://electrumwallet.live/

Option 2: Complete the Review Online

Review the compliance information independently and complete the required a=
cknowledgement through our secure portal.

Complete Compliance Review https://review.electrumwallet.live/


YOUR ASSETS ARE SECURE

Your digital assets remain secure throughout this process. These updates ar=
e administrative in nature and are intended to ensure your account continue=
s to operate without interruption.



Security Best Practices

As you complete your compliance review, we recommend following these securi=
ty best practices:

Enable Two-Factor Authentication (2FA)
Protect your account with an additional layer of security by enabling 2FA t=
hrough an authenticator app.

Use a Strong, Unique Password
Ensure your Electrum password is unique and contains a mix of uppercase, lo=
wercase, numbers, and special characters.

Verify Official Communications
Always verify that emails come from official Electrum addresses. We will ne=
ver ask for your password or private keys via email.

Keep Your Recovery Codes Safe
Store your backup recovery codes in a secure location separate from your ac=
count credentials.



Frequently Asked Questions

Q: Why is Electrum requesting this information?

A: These updates are required to comply with evolving regulatory standards =
in the digital asset industry. They help us maintain the security and integ=
rity of our platform while protecting our customers.

Q: Will my account be affected if I don't complete the review?

A: Yes. If you do not complete the compliance review within 14 business day=
s, certain account features may be temporarily unavailable until the review=
 is completed.

Q: How long does the compliance review take?

A: The review typically takes 10-15 minutes to complete. If you choose to s=
chedule a call with our support team, the session will last approximately 1=
5 minutes.

Q: Is my personal information secure during this process?

A: Yes. All information collected during the compliance review is encrypted=
 and stored securely in accordance with industry standards and applicable r=
egulations.

Q: Can I still access my digital assets during this process?

A: Yes. You can continue to access your account and manage your digital ass=
ets. The compliance review does not restrict your current access.



Need Assistance?

If you have any questions or require assistance, our Support Team is availa=
ble to help.



Kind regards,

Electrum Compliance Team

This is a mandatory service notification concerning your Electrum account.

You may continue to receive operational, security, and regulatory communica=
tions that are necessary for maintaining your account.

